    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "所有課程活動都將在同學之間的友好參與和互動氛圍中進行，彼此間尊重和欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點，如國內外各學制、多元入學及學習文化、性別等。希望您始終在本課程中應用最高的學術標準，並以有尊嚴和尊重的態度對待同學。",
    "course_pol_en": "All course activities will be carried out in an atmosphere of friendly participation and interaction among students, respecting and appreciating each student's personal experience, background, and perspectives, such as various school systems at home and abroad, diverse enrollment and learning cultures, gender, etc. You are expected to apply the highest academic standards throughout this course and to treat fellow students with dignity and respect.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。</div>\n\n<div>剽竊是對學術信任的嚴重破壞。在學習作業中，我們的言論和想法就是我們作業的價值。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Learning must be based on honesty. Any student who attempts to use a work that he has not produced as his own is considered dishonest.</div>\n\n<div>Plagiarism is a serious breach of academic trust. In schoolwork, our words and thoughts are the value of our work.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>When you use someone else&#39;s words and ideas, whether by a famous author or a classmate, without acknowledging the source of those articles, words, and ideas, you are plagiarizing.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
